node.solutions:
## solutions

#### depth first (recursive)

```js
const maxPathSum = (root) => {
  if (root === null) return -Infinity;
  if (root.left === null && root.right === null) return root.val;
  return root.val + Math.max(maxPathSum(root.left), maxPathSum(root.right));
};
```

- n = number of nodes
- Time: O(n)
- Space: O(n)

